    "detailed_description": "&quot;Mbembe Radio&quot; is a horror adventure game where you explore the way home from school, encountering strange occurrences and challenges along the way.<br />\r\nThe progression of the game includes elements of action and survival horror, where unexpected terrifying encounters may occur during exploration.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Story<br />\r\nThe popular radio show among children, 'Mbembe Radio,' presents small challenges each episode.<br />\r\nAfter school, our protagonist, Kimi, lets out a small sigh. She has to walk through a dimly lit forest all alone on her way home. <br />\r\na perfect challenge for Kimi was broadcasted on Mbembe Radio.<br />\r\n\u201dI'll give you fun challenges for the next three days on your way home from school.\u201d<br />\r\nLet's take on the challenges and make the journey home enjoyable. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Playtime<br />\r\n&quot;Mbembe Radio&quot; is a short game that lasts 20 to 60 minutes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Ending<br />\r\nThere are several endings.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6Uploading and livestreaming Guidelines<br />\r\nwelcome.<br />\r\nInclude the store page URL in the summary or description section of the video or livestream.",
